    "chunk_text": "The Committee reviewed the existing model and weighted criteria and proposed a revised methodology called Vulnerability-Based Targeting and Recertification System (VTRS). After extensive deliberations with the Department of Census and Statistics, the Department of National Planning and the World Bank, views and proposals were obtained. Accordingly, it had been decided to ascertain the appropriateness of this methodology by conducting a pilot study and approval of the Secretary to the Ministry of Finance was sought on June 09, 2026 to proceed with conducting the pilot study. Thus, it was decided to initiate a pilot test with the concurrence and assistance of the Department of Census and Statistics and upon the decision of it, further action will be determined. After the pilot study, it is expected to verify the criteria, the marks awarding procedure, operational definitions, practical use at the field level, data collection process and errors of inclusion and exclusion. Thereafter, the most appropriate methodology for selection and re-verification of beneficiaries in the future will be determined and reported to Parliament.\n\n(b) Not relevant.\n\n1195 1196\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0dd4\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dca\u0dda \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0bae\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0bae\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u0dc3\u0dd0.\u0dba\u0dd4.\n\n\u0da7\u0db8\u0db8 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0dc0\u0d9a\u0dca \u0d9a\u0da7\u0dda \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d85\u0dc0\u0db8\u0d9a\u0dca \u0dbd\u0d82\u0db8\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da7 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0db8\u0db3\u0dc4\u0d9a \u0dbd\u0d82\u0db8\u0dda\u0dc0\u0d9a\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0db1\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0dba\u0daf\u0dd2 \u0dbd\u0d82 \u0dc5 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0dba\u0dd4\u0dd4 \u0dbd\u0d82 \u0dd0\u0dca \u0dbd\u0d82\u0dba\u0dca\u0dc0\u0db1