    "chunk_text": "Ayurvedic hospitals in Sri Lanka are classified into various levels, and treatment services related to Shalya Tantra are already provided depending on the infrastructure, equipment and medical personnel available at each hospital.\n\n1395 1396\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4\u0dca\u0db4\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0dca\u0dda \u0dad\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bc8\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n2026 \u0d94\u0dca\u0dd9\u0dc0\u0ddd\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dc2\u0dbb22\n\nUnlike in the western medical treatment system, various Shalya Tantra procedures are used in Ayurveda, such as surgeries carried out using blunt instruments, surgeries carried out using sharp instruments, treatments performed using Herbo-mineral caustics, therapeutic cauterization, bloodletting and treatment methods for wounds. All these treatment procedures are applied in accordance with the specific disease and the patient. These procedures are considered accepted and recognized surgeries in Ayurveda.\n\nFor carrying out the aforementioned treatments, facilities such as an operating theatres, a recovery rooms/dressing rooms, wards and the necessary services of attendants are specified in Ayurveda Shalya Tantra.\n\nFurther information is provided in Annex*. (Please refer to Annex in Sinhala.)\n\n(ii) Does not arise.\n\n(b) (i) No.\n\n(ii) In the year 2000.\n\n(iii) No.\n\n(iv) Currently, a premature baby care unit is not maintained.\n\n(c) (i) Treatments are available."
  },
